.container
  {{view AIO.HeaderView noMenu=true}}

  .intro-content
    .copy-container
      .copy
        %h2 Step 1 of 3: Create a New Box
        %p
          :markdown
            A *box* is your _development environment_ on the Nitrous.IO platform.
        %p
          Creating one is lightning fast &mdash; pick a language or framework, give your box a name, and go!
    .action-container
      {{view AIO.BoxFormView}}

  .panel.clearfix
    %button.btn.btn-primary.pull-right(_action='didClickCreateBox target="view"'){ bind: { disabled: 'view.createBoxButtonDisabled' } }
      Create Box
